sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: To draw a straight line perpendicular to a given plane from a given elevated point.
----
proof:

Let *A* be the given elevated point, and the plane of reference the given plane.

It is required to draw from the point *A* a straight line perpendicular to the plane of reference.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="310" height="300" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="XI.11 diagram" src="propXI11.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
